{
  "thought": "I will implement the `dead_stock` function. I'll ensure the logic handles the single-pass iteration of `lines`, filters by `today`, skips comments, and correctly identifies dead stock based on the `idle_days` threshold and positive on-hand quantity.",
  "action": {
    "tool": "write_file",
